Baseline: upstream Linux v7.3, drivers/gpu/drm/amd.
Source: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/tree/v7.3/drivers/gpu/drm/amd

Driver-contained fixes and optimisations come from:
https://github.com/nanomatters/kernel-salkim
Branch: salkim-7.3
Revision: 0b07b37e42fbfc27047d4ed7e64405d69dfd3005

DRM core, scheduler, TTM and DMA-BUF changes are not imported. Display ports
are limited to changes that work with the upstream v7.3 DRM interfaces.
The HDMI VRR/ALLM, common EDID parser and passive VRR groups are excluded
because they depend on DRM core changes.
The private AMDGPU UAPI header includes the matching sparse-batch interface.
Local build changes add external-module Kbuild support and adjust the
AMDGPU trace-header include path. Existing copyright notices are preserved.

